# This directory contains website images and assets

## Current Files:
- logo-light.svg - Logo for dark backgrounds (navigation and footer)

## Files to Add:
- logo-dark.svg/png - Logo for light backgrounds (if needed)
- og-image.png - Open Graph image for social sharing (1200x630px)
- Any other images needed for the website

## Recommendations:
- Use SVG format for logos (scalable, smaller file size)
- Use WebP format for photos (better compression)
- Optimize all images before uploading
- Keep total image sizes under 500KB for fast loading
